      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "how can I change the language in Italian in the administrative panel,<br />\ndefault language exists Russia, Ukrainian and English<br />\nI put the folder renamed IT (10%) in &quot;languages&quot;, I changed this code in main.php but the language IT does not appear🙁<br />\n<br />\nSomebody help me<br />\nthanks<br />\n<br />\nmain.php (folder language/IT )<br />\n<br />\n&lt;code&gt;&lt;?php<br />\n<br />\nsetlocale(LC_ALL, &#039;it_IT.UTF-8&#039;);<br />\n$lang[&#039;CONTENT_ENCODING&#039;] = &#039;UTF-8&#039;;<br />\n<br />\n//<br />\n// Common, these terms are used<br />\n// extensively on several pages<br />\n//<br />\n$lang[&#039;ADMIN&#039;] = &#039;Amministrazione&#039;;<br />\n$lang[&#039;FORUM&#039;] = &#039;Forum&#039;;<br />\n$lang[&#039;CATEGORY&#039;] = &#039;Category&#039;;&lt;/code&gt;",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 6,
      "post_date": 1417342501,
      "user_id": 5769,
      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "LordStark"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 68385,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": true,
      "last_edit_date": 1417359425,
      "message_parsed": "<blockquote class=\"xfBb-quote\" data-name=\"LordStark\">how can I change the language in Italian in the administrative panel,<br />\ndefault language exists Russia, Ukrainian and English<br />\nI put the folder renamed IT (10%) in &quot;languages&quot;, I changed this code in main.php but the language IT does not appear🙁<br />\n<br />\nSomebody help me<br />\nthanks</blockquote><br />\n&#039;cause it should be &quot;it&quot; instead of &quot;IT&quot;, and you should better be in Italy (to select preferred language automatically).<br />\nAdd Italian into config.php<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$bb_cfg[&#039;languages&#039;] = array(\n//    &#039;folder&#039; =&gt; &#039;Name&#039;,\n    &#039;ru&#039;     =&gt; &#039;Русский&#039;,\n    &#039;uk&#039;     =&gt; &#039;Український&#039;,\n    &#039;en&#039;     =&gt; &#039;English&#039;,\n);</pre><br />\nchange with<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$bb_cfg[&#039;languages&#039;] = array(\n//    &#039;folder&#039; =&gt; &#039;Name&#039;,\n    &#039;ru&#039;     =&gt; &#039;Русский&#039;,\n    &#039;uk&#039;     =&gt; &#039;Український&#039;,\n    &#039;en&#039;     =&gt; &#039;English&#039;,\n    &#039;it&#039;     =&gt; &#039;Italian&#039;,\n);</pre>",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 7,
      "post_date": 1417358491,
      "user_id": 68,
